{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>The silver is given to you.</b> And the people, to do with them as you please. Now the letters were written on the 13th of Nisan, and Haman was hanged in Nisan. Our sages said that Mordecai fasted during the days of Passover. It is possible that the matter was not heard on the day the letters were written."], :book :esther, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kol Sason, Krotoschin, 1840" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001728315"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:29:51.631811786Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}